bottomparticipants

actor "Content Moderator" as MOD
boundary "Manga Management UI" as UI
boundary "Router" as RT
control "AccessTokenGuard" as ATG
control "RolesGuard" as RG
control "MangaController" as CT
control "MangaService" as SV
entity ":MangaModel" as MangaModel
database "MongoDB" as DB
activate MOD
activate UI

alt 1. Suspend manga
  MOD -> UI: 1.1 Choose Suspend
else Ban manga
  MOD -> UI: 1.2 Choose Ban
else Remove restriction
  MOD -> UI: 1.3 Choose Clear
end

opt Suspend/Ban with empty reason
  UI --> MOD: 1.4 Show validation
end

  UI -> RT: 2. PATCH enforcement
  activate RT

  ref over RT, RG : 3. Subsequence - Check auth and moderator role

  alt Unauthorized
    RT --> UI: 3.1.1 HTTP 401
    UI --> MOD: 3.1.2 Show login required
  else Permission denied
    RT --> UI: 3.2.1 HTTP 403
    UI --> MOD: 3.2.2 Show permission denied
end
    RT -> CT: 4. setEnforcementStatus()
    activate CT

    CT -> SV: 5. setEnforcementStatus(mangaId, actorId, status, reason)
    activate SV

    ref over SV, DB : 6. Subsequence - Validate ids and find manga

    alt Invalid mangaId or actorId
      SV --> CT: 6.1.1. BadRequest
      CT --> RT: 6.1.2. HTTP 400
      RT --> UI: 6.1.3. Action failed
      UI --> MOD: 6.1.4. Show error
    else Manga not found
      SV --> CT: 6.2.1. NotFound
      CT --> RT: 6.2.2. HTTP 404
      RT --> UI: 6.2.3. Action failed
      UI --> MOD: 6.2.4. Show error
    else Suspend/Ban without reason
        SV --> CT: 6.3.1. BadRequest
        CT --> RT: 6.3.2. HTTP 400
        RT --> UI: 6.3.3. Action failed
        UI --> MOD: 6.3.4. Show error
end
        ref over SV, DB : 7. Save enforcement update

        SV --> CT: 8. Enforcement result
        deactivate SV
        CT --> RT: 9. HTTP 200
        deactivate CT
        RT --> UI: 10. Update success
        deactivate RT
        UI --> MOD: 11. Show updated status
deactivate UI
deactivate MOD